*.meta
# Hollowmere engine baseline: this file is a generic, largely-irrelevant
# Visual-Studio-project .gitignore template (TFS/NuGet/Silverlight/Paket boilerplate
# that doesn't apply to this Unity project). Its blanket `*.meta` rule blocks Unity's
# own .meta files for every intentional Hollowmere Engine override under this
# directory - negated below for the confirmed engine files (see
# docs/architecture/ENGINE_MODIFICATIONS.md). This does not track .meta files for
# untouched symlinked source files - that's a separate, broader pre-existing gap
# documented alongside this milestone's report, not fixed here.
!src/CUOEnviroment.cs.meta
!src/Client.cs.meta
!src/Configuration/Profile.cs.meta
!src/Configuration/ProfileManager.cs.meta
!src/Configuration/Settings.cs.meta
!src/Game/CircleOfTransparency.cs.meta
